#N canvas 60 60 900 620 12;
#X declare -path alien -path ./lib -lib Gem;
#X text 40 24 alien-av-toolkit — START HERE;
#X text 40 46 An algorithmic audio/visual starting point for Pure Data built on the alien pattern language.;
#X text 40 92 ── 1. dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────;
#X text 40 112 Install Pd from https://msp.ucsd.edu/software.html \, then in Pd use Tools > Find externals to install:;
#X text 60 148 Gem — graphics;
#X text 60 166 else — audio objects;
#X text 60 184 alien — the pattern language + novelty objects;
#X text 60 202 alien-theme-plugin — dark canvas theme (restart Pd after installing);
#X obj 40 240 loadbang;
#X msg 40 268 bang;
#X obj 40 300 print DEPENDENCY-CHECK;
#X text 220 240 On load this prints the required-library reminder to the Pd console.;
#X msg 200 268 need: Gem else alien -- install via Tools > Find externals;
#X text 40 350 ── 2. keep patches at the TOP LEVEL of this folder ───────────────;
#X text 40 370 All asset paths (sounds/ textures/ alien_shaders/ lib/) are relative. A patch moved into a subfolder will not find its samples \, shaders or textures.;
#X text 40 420 ── 3. make your own set ──────────────────────────────────────────;
#X text 40 440 Click "Use this template" on GitHub to start my-performance with clean history \, or just copy this folder.;
#X text 40 486 ── example patches ───────────────────────────────────────────────;
#X text 40 506 tutorial-1.pd — walkthrough;
#X text 40 524 alien-example.pd — minimal alien -> sequencer chain;
#X text 40 542 __starter_template__.pd — full performance template;
#X connect 9 0 10 0;
#X connect 9 0 13 0;
#X connect 10 0 11 0;
#X connect 13 0 11 0;
